{"title":"Career roadmap · Product Executive","role":"Product Executive","summary":"A Product Executive supports the development, launch, improvement and day-to-day management of products or digital products. The role combines business understanding, customer research, product strategy, analytics, design thinking, technology awareness and cross-functional coordination.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1 UG · 2026","Current degree":"BBA / BMS / BBM – Innovation & Design Thinking"},"about":[{"label":"Typical entry route","text":"BBA → Product/Business Internship → Product Executive / Product Associate → Product Manager"},{"label":"Long-term direction","text":"Product Executive → Product Manager → Senior Product Manager → Group Product Manager / Product Lead → Head/Director of Product"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[{"period":"2026–2030","question":"What can I enter now?","output":"Build customer, business, design-thinking, analytics and technology foundations; complete product internships and a portfolio"},{"period":"2030–2035","question":"How should I specialise?","output":"Progress from Product Executive/Associate/APM toward Product Manager"},{"period":"2035–2040","question":"How should I evolve?","output":"Own larger products, product lines, markets or strategic initiatives"},{"period":"2040–2046","question":"How can I remain relevant?","output":"Move toward Product Lead, Group Product Manager, Director/Head of Product, product strategy or entrepreneurship"}],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"For a student pursuing BBA – Innovation & Design Thinking, Product Executive is a strong and relevant entry-level target. Depending on the organisation, similar entry roles may include Product Associate, Product Operations Associate, Product Analyst, Associate Product Manager (APM), Business Analyst or Product Management Trainee."}]},{"heading":"Career-route check","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Strong/direct alignment."},{"type":"p","text":"BBA Innovation & Design Thinking gives the student a useful foundation in customer understanding, ideation, business models, problem-solving and innovation. To become employable in product roles, the student should add product analytics, SQL, experimentation, UX basics, technology literacy and execution skills."},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"“Product Executive” is not a universally standardised job title. Companies may use Product Associate, Product Analyst, Product Operations Executive, Product Management Trainee or APM for similar entry-level responsibilities."},{"type":"h","text":"Timeline assumption"},{"type":"p","text":"This roadmap assumes a 4-year undergraduate programme beginning in 2026 and graduating around 2030. If the student's programme is 3 years, compress Years 1–3 and use the final year for internship, placement and specialisation."}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"These are practical career-planning horizons, not guaranteed promotion timelines."}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Business fundamentals, customer problems, communication, Excel, presentation"},{"text":"College curriculum, Microsoft Excel"},{"text":"1 business-analysis project"},{"text":"Business foundation"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"Design thinking, customer interviews, problem framing, ideation"},{"text":"Design-thinking courses, case studies"},{"text":"5–10 customer interviews + problem statement"},{"text":"Customer understanding"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"Product lifecycle, market research, UX basics, SQL fundamentals"},{"text":"Product case studies, SQL learning"},{"text":"Product teardown + SQL exercises"},{"text":"Product fundamentals"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"Product analytics, Power BI, experimentation, business metrics"},{"text":"Analytics courses, product analytics resources"},{"text":"Product dashboard + A/B-test case"},{"text":"Data-driven decisions"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"Agile, roadmaps, prioritisation, APIs, databases, software-development lifecycle"},{"text":"Agile/product/technical resources"},{"text":"Product requirements document + roadmap"},{"text":"Technology literacy"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"Product internship, stakeholder management, growth, retention"},{"text":"Industry internship + case studies"},{"text":"Internship deliverables + portfolio"},{"text":"Execution"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 1"},{"text":"Advanced product strategy, AI products, product analytics, business models"},{"text":"Product-management resources"},{"text":"End-to-end product case"},{"text":"Strategic thinking"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 2"},{"text":"Placement preparation, interviews, portfolio and product case practice"},{"text":"Company job descriptions + mock interviews"},{"text":"Resume + 3–5 strong product cases"},{"text":"Job readiness"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful learning resources include Microsoft Excel, Microsoft Power BI, SQLBolt and NPTEL.","url":"https://www.microsoft.com/microsoft-365/excel"},{"type":"h","text":"Core Product Executive skill stack"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Product thinking"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Problem identification"},{"text":"User needs"},{"text":"Jobs-to-be-done"},{"text":"Product-market fit"},{"text":"Value proposition"},{"text":"Product positioning"},{"text":"Product lifecycle"},{"text":"Feature prioritisation"},{"text":"Product strategy"},{"text":"Product-market research"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2. Design thinking"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Empathise","Define","Ideate","Prototype","Test","Iterate"]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User interviews"},{"text":"Observation"},{"text":"Personas"},{"text":"Customer journey mapping"},{"text":"Problem statements"},{"text":"How Might We questions"},{"text":"Brainstorming"},{"text":"Prototyping"},{"text":"Usability testing"},{"text":"Design validation"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Customer research"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Primary research"},{"text":"Secondary research"},{"text":"Surveys"},{"text":"Customer interviews"},{"text":"Competitor analysis"},{"text":"Market segmentation"},{"text":"Persona development"},{"text":"Customer journey"},{"text":"Pain-point analysis"},{"text":"Qualitative research"},{"text":"Quantitative research"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The student should be able to answer:"},{"type":"p","text":"Who has the problem, how serious is it, what alternatives exist, and why would the customer choose our solution?"},{"type":"h","text":"4. Business fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"Build knowledge of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Costs"},{"text":"Gross margin"},{"text":"Contribution margin"},{"text":"Pricing"},{"text":"Unit economics"},{"text":"CAC"},{"text":"LTV"},{"text":"Market size"},{"text":"TAM/SAM/SOM"},{"text":"Business models"},{"text":"Competitive advantage"},{"text":"Go-to-market strategy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. Product analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"DAU / WAU / MAU"},{"text":"Activation"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Churn"},{"text":"Conversion"},{"text":"Funnel analysis"},{"text":"Cohort analysis"},{"text":"Customer lifetime value"},{"text":"Feature adoption"},{"text":"Engagement"},{"text":"Revenue metrics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"6. SQL"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SELECT"},{"text":"WHERE"},{"text":"GROUP BY"},{"text":"HAVING"},{"text":"ORDER BY"},{"text":"CASE"},{"text":"JOINs"},{"text":"Subqueries"},{"text":"CTEs"},{"text":"Window functions"},{"text":"Aggregations"},{"text":"Date functions"},{"text":"NULL handling"}]},{"type":"p","text":"SQL is particularly valuable because modern product teams frequently rely on behavioural and business data."},{"type":"h","text":"7. UX/UI fundamentals"},{"type":"p","text":"The student does not need to become a full-time UI designer."},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User flows"},{"text":"Information architecture"},{"text":"Wireframes"},{"text":"Prototypes"},{"text":"Usability"},{"text":"Accessibility"},{"text":"Interaction design"},{"text":"Design systems"},{"text":"Mobile/web UX"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn a prototyping tool such as Figma and be able to convert a product problem into a basic user flow and prototype."},{"type":"h","text":"8. Technology literacy"},{"type":"p","text":"A Product Executive should understand how software products are built."},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Frontend vs backend"},{"text":"APIs"},{"text":"Databases"},{"text":"Authentication"},{"text":"Cloud basics"},{"text":"SDLC"},{"text":"Git/version control"},{"text":"Testing"},{"text":"Deployment"},{"text":"Agile development"},{"text":"Technical debt"},{"text":"System limitations"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful technical learning can include GitHub Skills and Postman Learning Center.","url":"https://skills.github.com/"},{"type":"h","text":"9. Agile and execution"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product backlog"},{"text":"User stories"},{"text":"Acceptance criteria"},{"text":"Sprint planning"},{"text":"Sprint review"},{"text":"Retrospectives"},{"text":"Scrum"},{"text":"Kanban"},{"text":"Roadmaps"},{"text":"Release planning"},{"text":"Dependency management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Atlassian Agile resources are useful for learning these concepts.","url":"https://www.atlassian.com/agile"},{"type":"h","text":"Product portfolio to build before graduation"},{"type":"p","text":"A strong student portfolio should contain 3–5 complete product cases, rather than dozens of superficial certificates."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Product teardown"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose a familiar product and analyse:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Customer segment"},{"text":"Core problem"},{"text":"Value proposition"},{"text":"User journey"},{"text":"Key features"},{"text":"Business model"},{"text":"Competitors"},{"text":"Strengths"},{"text":"Weaknesses"},{"text":"Suggested improvements"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Customer discovery"},{"type":"p","text":"Conduct:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"10–20 customer interviews"},{"text":"Problem clustering"},{"text":"Persona creation"},{"text":"Pain-point analysis"},{"text":"Problem prioritisation"},{"text":"Solution hypothesis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — MVP"},{"type":"p","text":"Build or prototype a simple solution."},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Problem"},{"text":"Target customer"},{"text":"MVP scope"},{"text":"User flow"},{"text":"Wireframes"},{"text":"Prototype"},{"text":"Product requirements"},{"text":"Success metrics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Product analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a dashboard showing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Acquisition"},{"text":"Activation"},{"text":"Engagement"},{"text":"Retention"},{"text":"Conversion"},{"text":"Revenue"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Use SQL + Power BI/Excel."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — AI product case"},{"type":"p","text":"Design an AI-enabled product."},{"type":"p","text":"Document:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"User problem"},{"text":"AI capability"},{"text":"User journey"},{"text":"Data required"},{"text":"Model/API concept"},{"text":"Evaluation metrics"},{"text":"Cost considerations"},{"text":"Human oversight"},{"text":"Privacy risks"},{"text":"Failure cases"},{"text":"Product KPIs"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Four-year honours / extended-degree variant"},{"type":"p","text":"If the university provides a 4-year honours/research pathway, use the additional depth for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced product analytics"},{"text":"Consumer research"},{"text":"AI product management"},{"text":"Business experimentation"},{"text":"Research methodology"},{"text":"Data analysis"},{"text":"Innovation management"},{"text":"Technology strategy"},{"text":"Entrepreneurship"},{"text":"A substantial product research project"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The fourth year should produce stronger evidence of independent product thinking, not simply more certificates."},{"type":"h","text":"Product specialisation lanes"},{"type":"table","header":["Lane","Core stack","Senior role it leads to"],"rows":[[{"text":"Consumer Product"},{"text":"UX + analytics + growth + experimentation"},{"text":"Consumer Product Manager"}],[{"text":"B2B SaaS"},{"text":"Product + APIs + workflows + customer research"},{"text":"B2B Product Manager"}],[{"text":"AI Product"},{"text":"AI/ML concepts + product + evaluation + UX"},{"text":"AI Product Manager"}],[{"text":"FinTech Product"},{"text":"Finance + payments + compliance + analytics"},{"text":"FinTech Product Manager"}],[{"text":"HealthTech Product"},{"text":"Healthcare + UX + data + privacy"},{"text":"HealthTech Product Manager"}],[{"text":"EdTech Product"},{"text":"Education + learning analytics + UX"},{"text":"EdTech Product Manager"}],[{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"Growth + merchandising + analytics + operations"},{"text":"E-commerce Product Manager"}],[{"text":"Product Analytics"},{"text":"SQL + statistics + BI + experimentation"},{"text":"Product Analytics Manager"}],[{"text":"Growth Product"},{"text":"Acquisition + activation + retention + experimentation"},{"text":"Growth Product Manager"}],[{"text":"Platform Product"},{"text":"APIs + architecture + integrations + strategy"},{"text":"Platform Product Manager"}],[{"text":"Product Operations"},{"text":"Processes + analytics + stakeholder management"},{"text":"Product Operations Manager"}],[{"text":"Entrepreneurship"},{"text":"Customer discovery + MVP + GTM + finance"},{"text":"Founder / Entrepreneur"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Evolve and stay relevant · 2035–2046"},{"type":"p","text":"Product management is increasingly becoming an AI-augmented discipline. A strong Product Executive should therefore progress beyond feature coordination into problem selection, customer insight, experimentation, analytics, business judgement and technology strategy."},{"type":"p","text":"By the mid-to-late 2030s, aim to understand:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI product development"},{"text":"AI agents"},{"text":"Human-AI interaction"},{"text":"Product experimentation"},{"text":"Causal inference"},{"text":"Personalisation"},{"text":"Predictive analytics"},{"text":"Privacy and responsible AI"},{"text":"Data governance"},{"text":"Platform ecosystems"},{"text":"Product-led growth"},{"text":"Global product strategy"}]},{"type":"p","text":"AI can accelerate research, analysis, prototyping and documentation, but senior product value increasingly comes from judgement, prioritisation, customer understanding and accountability for outcomes."}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Government, public-sector and research exposure"},{"type":"table","header":["Organisation / route","Possible exposure"],"rows":[[{"text":"NITI Aayog","url":"https://www.niti.gov.in/"},{"text":"Policy, innovation, digital initiatives, research"}],[{"text":"MoSPI","url":"https://www.mospi.gov.in/"},{"text":"Data, statistics and analytical projects"}],[{"text":"RBI","url":"https://www.rbi.org.in/"},{"text":"FinTech, payments, financial products and research"}],[{"text":"SEBI","url":"https://www.sebi.gov.in/"},{"text":"Financial markets, regulation and digital initiatives"}],[{"text":"MeitY","url":"https://www.meity.gov.in/"},{"text":"Digital technology and technology-policy exposure"}],[{"text":"Atal Innovation Mission","url":"https://aim.gov.in/"},{"text":"Innovation and entrepreneurship ecosystem"}],[{"text":"PM Internship Scheme","url":"https://pminternship.mca.gov.in/"},{"text":"Industry exposure where eligible"}],[{"text":"IITs / IIMs / universities"},{"text":"Research, innovation and product projects"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Eligibility varies by programme and year. Verify current requirements before applying."},{"type":"h","text":"Private-sector internships"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product Management Intern"},{"text":"Product Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Product Operations Intern"},{"text":"Business Analyst Intern"},{"text":"Growth Product Intern"},{"text":"UX Research Intern"},{"text":"Product Marketing Intern"},{"text":"Strategy Intern"},{"text":"Digital Product Intern"},{"text":"AI Product Intern"},{"text":"Product Analytics Intern"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Look across:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SaaS"},{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"E-commerce"},{"text":"EdTech"},{"text":"HealthTech"},{"text":"Consumer technology"},{"text":"Mobility"},{"text":"Logistics"},{"text":"AI startups"},{"text":"Enterprise software"},{"text":"Media platforms"},{"text":"D2C companies"}]},{"type":"p","text":"For a BBA student, startup product internships can be particularly valuable because the student may get exposure to customer research, product documentation, analytics and execution rather than only administrative work."}]},{"heading":"Certifications in demand","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Certification / learning route","Why it helps"],"rows":[[{"text":"NPTEL – Management / Innovation / Analytics"},{"text":"Academic foundation"}],[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Product and business analysis"}],[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Product analytics"}],[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Business/product dashboards"}],[{"text":"Google Analytics"},{"text":"Digital-product analytics"}],[{"text":"Agile / Scrum"},{"text":"Product-development process"}],[{"text":"Product Management"},{"text":"Product lifecycle and execution"}],[{"text":"UX / Design Thinking"},{"text":"Customer-centric product development"}],[{"text":"Statistics / Experimentation"},{"text":"A/B testing and decision-making"}],[{"text":"Project Management"},{"text":"Cross-functional execution"}],[{"text":"AI Product Management"},{"text":"AI-enabled products"}],[{"text":"Cloud fundamentals"},{"text":"Technology literacy"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Do not collect certificates without evidence of application. A product case + internship + analytical project is usually stronger evidence than several unrelated certificates."}]},{"heading":"Careers you can be hired as","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Realistic first-job titles"},{"type":"table","header":["Role","Stack the posting asks for","Where the student proves it"],"rows":[[{"text":"Product Executive"},{"text":"Product + business + execution"},{"text":"Product portfolio + internship"}],[{"text":"Product Associate"},{"text":"Product lifecycle + research"},{"text":"Product case studies"}],[{"text":"Product Analyst"},{"text":"SQL + analytics + product metrics"},{"text":"Analytics project"}],[{"text":"Product Operations Associate"},{"text":"Processes + analytics + coordination"},{"text":"Internship"}],[{"text":"Associate Product Manager"},{"text":"Product + customer + analytics"},{"text":"APM case preparation"}],[{"text":"Business Analyst"},{"text":"Requirements + SQL + business"},{"text":"BA project"}],[{"text":"Product Management Trainee"},{"text":"Business + product fundamentals"},{"text":"Internship + cases"}],[{"text":"Growth Analyst"},{"text":"Funnel + experimentation"},{"text":"Growth case"}],[{"text":"Product Marketing Associate"},{"text":"Positioning + research + GTM"},{"text":"Product launch case"}],[{"text":"UX Research Associate"},{"text":"Research + interviews + usability"},{"text":"Research portfolio"}],[{"text":"Strategy Analyst"},{"text":"Market + financial + analytical thinking"},{"text":"Market-sizing case"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Career reality"},{"type":"p","text":"A student should not depend only on the exact title “Product Executive.” Product hiring varies substantially between companies."},{"type":"p","text":"Search and apply across the broader entry-level product ecosystem:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Product Executive","Product Associate","Product Analyst","Product Operations","APM","Business Analyst"]}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["PG route","Best suited for"],"rows":[[{"text":"MBA Product Management"},{"text":"Product leadership"}],[{"text":"MBA Marketing"},{"text":"Consumer, growth and GTM products"}],[{"text":"MBA Business Analytics"},{"text":"Data-driven product management"}],[{"text":"MBA Strategy"},{"text":"Product strategy and consulting"}],[{"text":"MBA Technology Management"},{"text":"Business + technology"}],[{"text":"M.Sc Business Analytics"},{"text":"Product analytics"}],[{"text":"M.Sc Data Science"},{"text":"Data/AI product pathway"}],[{"text":"MCA"},{"text":"Stronger technical product pathway"}],[{"text":"M.Tech / M.E."},{"text":"Technical product roles, where eligible"}],[{"text":"M.Des / HCI-related PG"},{"text":"UX/product design pathway"}],[{"text":"PG Diploma in Product Management"},{"text":"Targeted industry specialisation"}],[{"text":"PhD"},{"text":"Research, academia or deep innovation"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"When should you do an MBA?"},{"type":"p","text":"An MBA is not automatically required immediately after BBA."},{"type":"p","text":"If the student obtains a strong Product Executive/APM/Product Analyst position, working for several years can provide valuable product experience before pursuing an MBA."},{"type":"h","text":"Research / scholarship routes"},{"type":"p","text":"Depending on the programme and eligibility, explore:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PMRF","url":"https://www.pmrf.in/"},{"text":"UGC fellowships"},{"text":"CSIR/other research fellowships where discipline-eligible"},{"text":"Institute-specific research assistantships"},{"text":"University scholarships"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Eligibility and funding amounts should be checked for the specific programme and admission year."}]},{"heading":"Study abroad, country by country","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Country","Example universities / ecosystem","Scholarship route","Gate to check"],"rows":[[{"text":"USA"},{"text":"Carnegie Mellon, MIT, Stanford, University of Michigan, Georgia Tech"},{"text":"University funding, Fulbright where eligible"},{"text":"Programme prerequisites, finances, visa"}],[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"Imperial, UCL, Warwick, Manchester, Edinburgh"},{"text":"University scholarships, Chevening where eligible"},{"text":"Programme requirements and deadlines"}],[{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"TUM, RWTH Aachen, University of Mannheim, LMU Munich"},{"text":"DAAD, university funding"},{"text":"Programme language, prerequisites, finances"}],[{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"University of Toronto, UBC, Waterloo, McGill"},{"text":"University funding, external scholarships"},{"text":"Admission, finances, immigration rules"}],[{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"University of Melbourne, UNSW, Monash, University of Sydney"},{"text":"University scholarships, Australia Awards where eligible"},{"text":"Programme and visa requirements"}],[{"text":"Netherlands"},{"text":"TU Delft, University of Amsterdam, Erasmus University Rotterdam"},{"text":"University scholarships"},{"text":"Programme prerequisites"}],[{"text":"Singapore"},{"text":"NUS, NTU, SMU"},{"text":"University scholarships"},{"text":"Highly competitive admissions"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Useful official scholarship resources include DAAD India and USIEF.","url":"https://www.daad.in/en/"},{"type":"h","text":"Application pack"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strong academic record"},{"text":"IELTS/TOEFL if required"},{"text":"GMAT/GRE if required"},{"text":"CV"},{"text":"Statement of Purpose"},{"text":"Letters of Recommendation"},{"text":"Product portfolio"},{"text":"Internship evidence"},{"text":"Research/project evidence"},{"text":"Financial documents"},{"text":"Passport and visa documents"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Requirements vary significantly by university and programme."}]},{"heading":"Going forward","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA – Innovation & Design Thinking","Product / Business Internship","Product Executive / Product Associate / Product Analyst","Associate Product Manager","Product Manager","Senior Product Manager","Group Product Manager / Product Lead","Director / Head of Product","VP Product / Chief Product Officer / Founder"]},{"type":"p","text":"Promotion speed depends on performance, company structure, product ownership and market conditions."},{"type":"h","text":"PhD routes"},{"type":"p","text":"A student interested in research can eventually pursue:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PhD in Management"},{"text":"PhD in Marketing"},{"text":"PhD in Innovation Management"},{"text":"PhD in Information Systems"},{"text":"PhD in Human-Computer Interaction"},{"text":"PhD in Technology Management"},{"text":"PhD in Operations / Strategy"},{"text":"PhD in Entrepreneurship"},{"text":"PhD in Consumer Behaviour"},{"text":"PhD in Business Analytics"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Potential research areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI product adoption"},{"text":"Human-AI interaction"},{"text":"Digital product innovation"},{"text":"Product-market fit"},{"text":"Platform economics"},{"text":"Consumer behaviour"},{"text":"Product experimentation"},{"text":"Digital transformation"},{"text":"Responsible AI"},{"text":"Innovation ecosystems"},{"text":"Product-led growth"}]},{"type":"note","label":"2040–2046","text":"Long-term evolution"},{"type":"p","text":"By this stage, the goal should be to move beyond managing individual features and become responsible for product outcomes and business impact."},{"type":"p","text":"Potential destinations include:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Product Manager","Senior Product Manager","Group Product Manager","Product Lead","Director of Product","Head of Product","VP Product / Chief Product Officer"]},{"type":"p","text":"Alternative paths include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Product Strategy"},{"text":"Product Consulting"},{"text":"Innovation Leadership"},{"text":"Digital Transformation"},{"text":"Venture Building"},{"text":"Startup Founder"},{"text":"AI Product Leadership"},{"text":"Product Analytics Leadership"},{"text":"Technology Strategy"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest long-term profile will combine:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Customer Understanding","Business Strategy","Product Execution","Analytics","Technology","AI","Leadership"],"sep":"+"}]}]}